# Quickshell singletons that still end in Config, Store or Manager (lib/check/steps/qml_singleton_names.py), one per line:
#   <file under the Quickshell tree>  # <reason> (<item that removes it>)
# Every entry is temporary: the rename deletes its line in the same commit, and a line whose file no longer matches fails
# as stale. "5.8 PR n" means PR n of item 5.8 of the Quickshell refactor (#966).
